1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,880
One worn part can stop a favorite routine.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:08,138
This frappé maker's agitator is worn.

3
00:00:08,258 --> 00:00:12,443
The app asks which device it came from.

4
00:00:12,563 --> 00:00:15,702
The label under the base answers.

5
00:00:15,822 --> 00:00:20,006
Search the web brings back the maker's
part.

6
00:00:20,126 --> 00:00:25,880
Check fit turns every unknown into a
question for the seller.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,738
For unused electronics, Muse Spark
proposes builds from the inventory.

8
00:00:31,858 --> 00:00:36,448
A home automation server is selected and
drawn.

9
00:00:36,568 --> 00:00:42,880
What is missing becomes a Marketplace
search that the owner runs.

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,880
What is not needed becomes a Marketplace
draft.

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:49,956
Orphan Parts Lens.

12
00:00:50,076 --> 00:00:51,380
Find replacements.

13
00:00:51,500 --> 00:00:52,804
Discover reuse.

14
00:00:52,924 --> 00:00:54,880
Build something useful.

